{
  "name": "Close-Quarters Shooting",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn to handle yourself in close combat. Making a ranged Attack Roll while within 5 feet of an enemy doesn't impose Disadvantage on your roll.</p><p>In addition, if you hit a creature within 5 feet of you with a ranged attack on your turn, that creature can't take Reactions until the end of this turn.</p>",
